# Local dev secrets for `pnpm preview` (wrangler dev).
# Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored).

# Ed25519 signing key set for /.well-known/taistamp.
# Optional — leave unset to serve unsigned TAI64N labels.
#
# Format: one or more `selector:base64-seed` entries,
# whitespace- or punctuation-separated; the last entry signs
# new responses. Selector matches
# [A-Za-z]([A-Za-z0-9_-]{0,61}[A-Za-z0-9])?; seed is 32 bytes
# of RFC 4648 §4 base64 (e.g. `openssl rand -base64 32`).
#
# To enable, uncomment and substitute a real seed:
# TAISTAMP_SECRET=mykey:<base64-encoded 32 bytes>
